## 7. Response JSON Example

Example response for Revenue and Cost by Country:

```json
{
  "data": [
    {
      "Sales.country": "India",
      "Sales.revenue": "123456789.00",
      "Sales.cost": "95000000.00"
    },
    {
      "Sales.country": "USA",
      "Sales.revenue": "234567890.00",
      "Sales.cost": "180000000.00"
    }
  ]
}